---
import StaticWikiPage from "../components/StaticWikiPage.astro";
import { getPageByRoute } from "../core/site-data";

const page = getPageByRoute("/official-links/");
---

<StaticWikiPage page={page}>
  <h2>Primary Sources</h2>
  <p>
    Use these links when you need to confirm the current Bodycam game,
    official update notes, system requirements, or Reissad Studio channels.
    They are the source anchors for this guide set.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/2406770/Bodycam/">Steam Store</a>
      - official store page for Bodycam, Steam App ID 2406770, developer,
      publisher, Early Access state, platform support, reviews, media, and PC
      requirements.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2406770">Steam News</a>
      - official update and patch-note feed for Locked & Loaded and later
      maintenance checks.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.playbodycam.com/en-US">Official Bodycam website</a>
      - Reissad Studio's player-facing feature, media, and community hub.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ReissadStudio">Reissad Studio YouTube</a>
      - official trailers and devlogs, including the Locked & Loaded trailer
      and v0.8 devlog series.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/reissadstudio">Official Discord invite</a>
      - community entry point advertised by official Bodycam sources.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to Use This Page</h2>
  <p>
    If a guide makes a claim about a patch, requirement, mode, map, or system,
    prefer these official sources over copied wiki text or social posts. Steam
    News is the best starting point for update timing. Steam appdetails is the
    best starting point for system requirements.
  </p>

  <h2>Evidence Boundary</h2>
  <p>
    Competitor pages and community discussions can reveal useful questions, but
    they do not turn exact stats, formulas, tier lists, player-count numbers, or
    console availability into verified Bodycam facts.
  </p>
</StaticWikiPage>
